    (para "Implement **Protocol 0** (Text/JSON-RPC 2.0) for YX protocol, enabling JSON-based RPC communication over UDP with HMAC authentication.")
    (para "**Wire Format:**")
    (code "[HMAC(16)] + [GUID(6)] + [0x00] + [UTF-8 JSON]")
    (para "**Protocol Stack:**")
    (code "Application Layer (RPC Methods)
        ↓
    RPCDispatcher
        ↓
   TextProtocol (Protocol 0)
        ↓
  ProtocolRouter (0x00 → TextProtocol)
        ↓
  TransportLayer (HMAC + GUID)
        ↓
      UDP Socket"))
